{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"CarePulse — AI-Enhanced Smart Diaper Monitoring API","description":"CarePulse Backend API providing real-time smart diaper telemetry, patient status tracking, alert escalation systems, historical analytics, and AI health insights. Designed for geriatric, rehabilitation, and long-term care facilities.","version":"1.0.0"},"paths":{"/auth/login":{"post":{"tags":["authentication"],"summary":"Login","description":"Authenticate user credentials and issue an 8-hour JWT bearer access token.","operationId":"login_auth_login_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UserLogin"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Token"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/patients":{"get":{"tags":["patients"],"summary":"Read Patients","description":"Retrieve a paginated list of patients.\n\n- **archived=active** (default): only non-archived patients\n- **archived=archived**: only archived patients\n- **archived=all**: every patient regardless of archive status\n\nReturns lightweight summary rows (no nested telemetry data).","operationId":"read_patients_patients_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"skip","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":0,"title":"Skip"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":100,"title":"Limit"}},{"name":"archived","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Filter: 'active' (default) | 'archived' | 'all'","default":"active","title":"Archived"},"description":"Filter: 'active' (default) | 'archived' | 'all'"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PatientSummaryOut"},"title":"Response Read Patients Patients Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["patients"],"summary":"Create Patient","description":"Register a new patient in the monitoring system.\n\n- **device_id** must be globally unique (one device per patient).\n- Returns the full patient object, ready for the detail panel.\n\nRaises **409 Conflict** if the device_id is already in use.","operationId":"create_patient_patients_post","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PatientCreate"}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PatientOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/patients/{patient_id}":{"get":{"tags":["patients"],"summary":"Read Patient","description":"Retrieve full details for a single patient including nested relationships:\nalerts, urination events, and AI insights.","operationId":"read_patient_patients__patient_id__get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"patient_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","title":"Patient Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PatientOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}},"put":{"tags":["patients"],"summary":"Update Patient","description":"Fully replace a patient's mutable fields.\n\nAll fields from PatientCreate are required. Optional disease fields\nmay be set to null by omitting them from the request body.\n\nRaises **404** if the patient does not exist.\nRaises **409 Conflict** if the new device_id is used by another patient.","operationId":"update_patient_patients__patient_id__put","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"patient_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","title":"Patient Id"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PatientCreate"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PatientOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/patients/{patient_id}/archive":{"patch":{"tags":["patients"],"summary":"Archive Patient","description":"Soft-archive a patient.\n\nSets **is_archived = True**. All historical data (alerts, sensor events,\nAI insights) is fully preserved. The patient is excluded from the active\npatient list but remains queryable via **GET /patients?archived=archived**.\n\nRaises **404** if the patient does not exist.","operationId":"archive_patient_patients__patient_id__archive_patch","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"patient_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","title":"Patient Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PatientOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/alerts":{"get":{"tags":["alerts"],"summary":"Read Alerts","description":"Retrieve a list of alerts, with optional filters.\nUnresolved alerts are returned first, sorted by most recent first.\nRequires authentication.","operationId":"read_alerts_alerts_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"resolved","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Filter by resolution status (true = resolved, false = active)","title":"Resolved"},"description":"Filter by resolution status (true = resolved, false = active)"},{"name":"severity","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Filter by severity (critical, warning, info)","title":"Severity"},"description":"Filter by severity (critical, warning, info)"},{"name":"alert_type","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Filter by alert type (high_wetness, low_battery, device_offline, diaper_changed, check_required)","title":"Alert Type"},"description":"Filter by alert type (high_wetness, low_battery, device_offline, diaper_changed, check_required)"},{"name":"skip","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":0,"title":"Skip"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":100,"title":"Limit"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AlertOut"},"title":"Response Read Alerts Alerts Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/analytics/wetness-trend":{"get":{"tags":["analytics"],"summary":"Read Wetness Trend","description":"Retrieve average and peak wetness levels bucketed into time intervals,\nused to render the wetness trend area chart.\nRequires authentication.","operationId":"read_wetness_trend_analytics_wetness_trend_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of days of history to include","default":7,"title":"Days"},"description":"Number of days of history to include"},{"name":"bucket_hours","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Time bucket interval in hours","default":4,"title":"Bucket Hours"},"description":"Time bucket interval in hours"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WetnessTrendPoint"},"title":"Response Read Wetness Trend Analytics Wetness Trend Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/analytics/urination-frequency":{"get":{"tags":["analytics"],"summary":"Read Urination Frequency","description":"Retrieve the count of daily urination events across all patients,\nused to render the daily frequency bar chart.\nRequires authentication.","operationId":"read_urination_frequency_analytics_urination_frequency_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of days of history to include","default":7,"title":"Days"},"description":"Number of days of history to include"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DailyEventCount"},"title":"Response Read Urination Frequency Analytics Urination Frequency Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/dashboard/stats":{"get":{"tags":["dashboard"],"summary":"Read Dashboard Stats","description":"Retrieve real-time aggregate statistics for the dashboard KPI cards,\nwetness distribution, and device status counts.\nRequires authentication.","operationId":"read_dashboard_stats_dashboard_stats_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DashboardStats"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/ai-insights":{"get":{"tags":["ai-insights"],"summary":"Read Ai Insights","description":"Retrieve AI health insights for monitored patients, ordered by generation timestamp (newest first).\nRequires authentication.","operationId":"read_ai_insights_ai_insights_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"skip","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":0,"title":"Skip"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":50,"title":"Limit"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AIInsightOut"},"title":"Response Read Ai Insights Ai Insights Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/ai-insights/generate/{patient_id}":{"post":{"tags":["ai-insights"],"summary":"Generate Patient Insight","description":"POST /ai-insights/generate/{patient_id}\n\nRegenerate a disease-aware AI insight for a specific patient.\nCreates a NEW AIInsight record (preserves historical insights).\n\nUses the Level 3 rule engine: Disease + Telemetry + Alerts.\n\nReturns the newly generated AIInsightOut object.","operationId":"generate_patient_insight_ai_insights_generate__patient_id__post","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"patient_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","title":"Patient Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AIInsightOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/gemini/report/{patient_id}":{"post":{"tags":["gemini-clinical-intelligence"],"summary":"Generate Clinical Report","description":"POST /gemini/report/{patient_id}\n\nGenerate a Gemini-powered clinical narrative report for a patient.\n\nWorkflow:\n    1. Fetch patient from database\n    2. Retrieve the latest rule engine insight (or generate one)\n    3. Run telemetry and alert analysis from the rule engine\n    4. Pass all structured data to the Gemini service\n    5. Return the combined rule engine + Gemini narrative report\n\nAuthentication: Required (JWT Bearer token)","operationId":"generate_clinical_report_gemini_report__patient_id__post","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"patient_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","title":"Patient Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GeminiReportOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/telemetry":{"post":{"tags":["Telemetry"],"summary":"Save an ESP32 telemetry reading","description":"Validates and persists a raw sensor reading from the ESP32 device. Returns the saved record including the server-generated id and timestamp. IoT metadata fields (wifi_rssi, firmware_version, esp32_timestamp) are optional for backward compatibility with older firmware.","operationId":"create_telemetry_telemetry_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TelemetryCreate"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TelemetryOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/telemetry/latest":{"get":{"tags":["Telemetry"],"summary":"Get the most recent telemetry reading","description":"Returns the single most recent telemetry reading across all devices.","operationId":"get_latest_telemetry_telemetry_latest_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TelemetryOut"}}}}}}},"/telemetry/recent":{"get":{"tags":["Telemetry"],"summary":"Get recent telemetry readings","description":"Returns the most recent telemetry readings, newest first.","operationId":"get_recent_telemetry_telemetry_recent_get","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":1000,"minimum":1,"description":"Max rows to return","default":100,"title":"Limit"},"description":"Max rows to return"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TelemetryOut"},"title":"Response Get Recent Telemetry Telemetry Recent Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/":{"get":{"tags":["system"],"summary":"Read Root","description":"API Root Endpoint showing service metadata.","operationId":"read_root__get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/health":{"get":{"tags":["system"],"summary":"Read Health","description":"Basic health check endpoint to confirm API service status.","operationId":"read_health_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}}},"components":{"schemas":{"AIInsightOut":{"properties":{"patient_id":{"type":"integer","exclusiveMinimum":0.0,"title":"Patient Id","example":1},"risk_score":{"type":"integer","maximum":100.0,"minimum":0.0,"title":"Risk Score","example":72},"risk_level":{"type":"string","title":"Risk Level","description":"One of: low | moderate | high | critical","example":"high"},"trend_direction":{"type":"string","title":"Trend Direction","description":"One of: up | down | stable","example":"up"},"trend_percent":{"type":"number","minimum":0.0,"title":"Trend Percent","example":18.0},"insight_text":{"type":"string","minLength":10,"title":"Insight Text","example":"Urination frequency increased by 18%..."},"risk_explanation":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Risk Explanation","example":"Risk is elevated due to CKD."},"recommendation":{"type":"string","minLength":10,"title":"Recommendation","example":"Monitor hydration levels..."},"monitoring_advice":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Monitoring Advice","example":"Check output every 4 hours."},"confidence":{"type":"number","maximum":100.0,"minimum":0.0,"title":"Confidence","example":87.0},"tags":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","maxLength":500},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Tags","description":"Comma-separated clinical category tags","example":"Post-Stroke,Neurogenic,Frequency Trend"},"generated_by":{"type":"string","title":"Generated By","default":"rule_engine"},"generated_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","title":"Generated At","example":"2026-06-13T13:00:00"},"id":{"type":"integer","title":"Id"},"created_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","title":"Created At"},"disease":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Disease"},"disease_severity":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Disease Severity"}},"type":"object","required":["patient_id","risk_score","risk_level","trend_direction","trend_percent","insight_text","recommendation","confidence","generated_at","id","created_at"],"title":"AIInsightOut","description":"Schema for GET /ai-insights responses."},"AlertOut":{"properties":{"patient_id":{"type":"integer","exclusiveMinimum":0.0,"title":"Patient Id","example":1},"alert_type":{"type":"string","title":"Alert Type","description":"One of: high_wetness | low_battery | device_offline | diaper_changed | check_required","example":"high_wetness"},"severity":{"type":"string","title":"Severity","description":"One of: critical | warning | info","example":"critical"},"message":{"type":"string","minLength":5,"title":"Message","example":"Wetness level reached 89% — immediate diaper change required."},"id":{"type":"integer","title":"Id"},"resolved":{"type":"boolean","title":"Resolved"},"resolved_at":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Resolved At"},"created_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","title":"Created At"}},"type":"object","required":["patient_id","alert_type","severity","message","id","resolved","resolved_at","created_at"],"title":"AlertOut","description":"Schema for GET /alerts responses."},"DailyEventCount":{"properties":{"date":{"type":"string","title":"Date"},"event_count":{"type":"integer","title":"Event Count"}},"type":"object","required":["date","event_count"],"title":"DailyEventCount","description":"Total urination events per calendar day.\nReturned as a list from GET /analytics/daily-events."},"DashboardStats":{"properties":{"total_patients":{"type":"integer","title":"Total Patients"},"active_alerts":{"type":"integer","title":"Active Alerts"},"connected_devices":{"type":"integer","title":"Connected Devices"},"today_event_count":{"type":"integer","title":"Today Event Count"},"count_dry":{"type":"integer","title":"Count Dry"},"count_slightly_wet":{"type":"integer","title":"Count Slightly Wet"},"count_moderately_wet":{"type":"integer","title":"Count Moderately Wet"},"count_saturated":{"type":"integer","title":"Count Saturated"},"devices_online":{"type":"integer","title":"Devices Online"},"devices_offline":{"type":"integer","title":"Devices Offline"},"devices_maintenance":{"type":"integer","title":"Devices Maintenance"}},"type":"object","required":["total_patients","active_alerts","connected_devices","today_event_count","count_dry","count_slightly_wet","count_moderately_wet","count_saturated","devices_online","devices_offline","devices_maintenance"],"title":"DashboardStats","description":"Aggregate statistics returned by GET /dashboard/stats.\nMaps directly to the KPI cards displayed on the frontend Dashboard page."},"GeminiReportOut":{"properties":{"patient_id":{"type":"integer","title":"Patient Id"},"patient_name":{"type":"string","title":"Patient Name"},"patient_age":{"type":"integer","title":"Patient Age"},"patient_ward":{"type":"string","title":"Patient Ward"},"patient_room":{"type":"string","title":"Patient Room"},"disease":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Disease"},"disease_severity":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Disease Severity"},"diagnosis_duration":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Diagnosis Duration"},"risk_score":{"type":"integer","title":"Risk Score"},"risk_level":{"type":"string","title":"Risk Level"},"trend_direction":{"type":"string","title":"Trend Direction"},"trend_percent":{"type":"number","title":"Trend Percent"},"confidence":{"type":"number","title":"Confidence"},"rule_engine_insight":{"type":"string","title":"Rule Engine Insight"},"rule_engine_risk_explanation":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Rule Engine Risk Explanation"},"rule_engine_recommendation":{"type":"string","title":"Rule Engine Recommendation"},"rule_engine_monitoring":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Rule Engine Monitoring"},"telemetry_event_count":{"type":"integer","title":"Telemetry Event Count","default":0},"telemetry_avg_wetness":{"type":"number","title":"Telemetry Avg Wetness","default":0.0},"telemetry_max_wetness":{"type":"number","title":"Telemetry Max Wetness","default":0.0},"telemetry_avg_daily_freq":{"type":"number","title":"Telemetry Avg Daily Freq","default":0.0},"alert_active_count":{"type":"integer","title":"Alert Active Count","default":0},"alert_critical_active":{"type":"integer","title":"Alert Critical Active","default":0},"alert_total_7d":{"type":"integer","title":"Alert Total 7D","default":0},"clinical_summary":{"type":"string","title":"Clinical Summary","default":""},"caregiver_recommendation":{"type":"string","title":"Caregiver Recommendation","default":""},"nursing_notes":{"type":"string","title":"Nursing Notes","default":""},"monitoring_plan":{"type":"string","title":"Monitoring Plan","default":""},"priority_actions":{"type":"string","title":"Priority Actions","default":""},"patient_explanation":{"type":"string","title":"Patient Explanation","default":""},"generated_at":{"type":"string","title":"Generated At","default":""},"generated_by_risk":{"type":"string","title":"Generated By Risk","default":"CarePulse Rule Engine (Level 3)"},"generated_by_narrative":{"type":"string","title":"Generated By Narrative","default":"Google Gemini 2.0 Flash"}},"type":"object","required":["patient_id","patient_name","patient_age","patient_ward","patient_room","risk_score","risk_level","trend_direction","trend_percent","confidence","rule_engine_insight","rule_engine_recommendation"],"title":"GeminiReportOut","description":"Full clinical report response combining Rule Engine metrics\nand Gemini-generated clinical narratives.\n\nThe Rule Engine fields are the authoritative source of truth.\nGemini fields are narrative-only — they must never contradict\nor recalculate any Rule Engine value."},"HTTPValidationError":{"properties":{"detail":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationError"},"type":"array","title":"Detail"}},"type":"object","title":"HTTPValidationError"},"PatientCreate":{"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","maxLength":100,"minLength":2,"title":"Name","example":"Margaret Chen"},"age":{"type":"integer","maximum":130.0,"minimum":0.0,"title":"Age","example":78},"ward":{"type":"string","maxLength":100,"minLength":2,"title":"Ward","example":"Geriatric Care"},"room":{"type":"string","maxLength":20,"minLength":1,"title":"Room","example":"3A-101"},"condition":{"type":"string","maxLength":200,"minLength":2,"title":"Condition","example":"Post-stroke rehabilitation"},"caregiver_name":{"type":"string","maxLength":100,"minLength":2,"title":"Caregiver Name","example":"Nurse Rachel Kim"},"device_id":{"type":"string","maxLength":50,"minLength":3,"title":"Device Id","example":"CP-DEV-001"},"notes":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","maxLength":2000},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Notes","example":"UTI history. Requires frequent monitoring."},"disease":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","maxLength":200},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Disease","description":"Canonical disease name consumed by the AI Clinical Insights engine","example":"Chronic Kidney Disease"},"disease_severity":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","maxLength":20},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Disease Severity","description":"One of: mild | moderate | severe | critical","example":"severe"},"diagnosis_date":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"date"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Diagnosis Date","description":"ISO date of formal diagnosis — enables disease_duration_days in AI prompts","example":"2024-03-15"}},"type":"object","required":["name","age","ward","room","condition","caregiver_name","device_id"],"title":"PatientCreate","description":"Schema for POST /patients — all fields required."},"PatientOut":{"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","maxLength":100,"minLength":2,"title":"Name","example":"Margaret Chen"},"age":{"type":"integer","maximum":130.0,"minimum":0.0,"title":"Age","example":78},"ward":{"type":"string","maxLength":100,"minLength":2,"title":"Ward","example":"Geriatric Care"},"room":{"type":"string","maxLength":20,"minLength":1,"title":"Room","example":"3A-101"},"condition":{"type":"string","maxLength":200,"minLength":2,"title":"Condition","example":"Post-stroke rehabilitation"},"caregiver_name":{"type":"string","maxLength":100,"minLength":2,"title":"Caregiver Name","example":"Nurse Rachel Kim"},"device_id":{"type":"string","maxLength":50,"minLength":3,"title":"Device Id","example":"CP-DEV-001"},"notes":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","maxLength":2000},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Notes","example":"UTI history. Requires frequent monitoring."},"disease":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","maxLength":200},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Disease","description":"Canonical disease name consumed by the AI Clinical Insights engine","example":"Chronic Kidney Disease"},"disease_severity":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","maxLength":20},{"type"